# CG

Display name is **CG** (broadcast Character Generator). Keep it. Do **not** rename to Overlay, Graphics, GFX, Live, Board, or Item.

This is the locked vocabulary for code, UI copy, DB, routes, and the subdomain. If a new Element needs a payload key, add it under `payload` jsonb — do not invent a parallel table or a second token scheme. For Panel / Desk UI details read `cg-panel-ui.mdc`.

| Surface | Locked name |
|---|---|
| Launcher / `tyapp_app_feature.name` | `CG` |
| Route | `/cg` (`/cg/list`, `/cg/new`, `/cg/edit/:id`, `/cg/edit/:id/layer/:layerId`) |
| Overlay path | `/o/:token` on the CG host; fallback `/cg-live/:token` on Jaxfr |
| Subdomain | `cg` → `https://cg.tszyin.com` / `http://cg.localhost:4200` |
| Code | `features/cg/`, `apps/cg/` (overlay), `core/domains/cg/` |
| Panel files | `cg-package-edit.*` (skeleton is `*-edit`; the page is still Panel) |
| Layer desk | `cg-layer-edit.*` nested on the Panel at `/cg/edit/:id/layer/:layerId` (not a second page) |

## UI words

| Word | Means | Example |
|---|---|---|
| **Package** | One look to use together | CH36, News SNG |
| **Element** | Kind in the catalog (code registry `CG_ELEMENT_CATALOG`) | Logo, Clock, Ticker |
| **Layer** | One instance inside a Package | CH36's Logo |
| **Panel** | This Package's operator page | Left Package (main), right Layers |
| **Output** | OBS URL (full-frame transparent Stage) | Package Output (default), Layer Output |
| **Stage** | 16:9 canvas | Tile thumbs, On air / Pending, overlay |
| **On air** | What OBS has (last Save, or live in Direct) | Monitor(s) in the left column |
| **Pending** | Unsaved draft mix (**Studio mode** only) | Save promotes it to On air |
| **Direct** | OBS-style: edit Program live | One On air monitor; auto-save to air |
| **Studio mode** | OBS Studio Mode: Preview then Program | Pending \| On air; Save to air |

**Channel / Source** stay on the Package as `role`. Clock is not Timer. Overlay is the public page implementation, not a product noun. Welcome → CG and every CG subpage skip the Jaxfr page crossfade (instant swap). UI copy is **sentence case** (no `text-transform: uppercase`). **Studio mode** is not the **Alpha / Dim** stage backdrop.

## Tables and columns (final)

`tyapp_cg_package` PK `tb_tyapp_cgpk_id` (seq `tb_tyapp_cgpk_seq_no`):

`name`, `role` (`channel` \| `source`), `public_token`, `duration_ms` (`0` = cut, default `400` = fade), `look` (`color` \| `mono`), `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `deleted_at`

`tyapp_cg_layer` PK `tb_tyapp_cgly_id` (seq `tb_tyapp_cgly_seq_no`):

`package_id` → package PK, `element_type`, `public_token`, `layout` jsonb, `payload` jsonb, `visible` (On/Off), `look` (`inherit` \| `color` \| `mono`; default `inherit` = Package Look), `sort_order`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `deleted_at`

**Layout jsonb:** `x`, `y`, `unit` (`percent` \| `px`), `anchor`, `scale`, `width`, `height`.
- **9-grid placement (every Element, now and future)** is inset-from-anchor, one shared function `anchoredBoxCss` in `cg.util.ts`: Anchor picks a cell of the Stage; X/Y are offsets from that cell's edges (Top right + 5,5 = 5 from right and top). On a centre axis the item is centered and that axis' X/Y is **ignored** (`anchorIgnoresAxis`): Top/Bottom center ignore X, Center left/right ignore Y, Center ignores both. Stored X/Y are kept so switching Anchor back restores them. Do not add a second positioning model for a new Element.
- Logo `scale` is a CSS transform. Optional stored `width` still applies if present.
- **Subtitle** uses the same placement; its `width` (default 88%) is the box the Anchor places. **Alignment** (`payload.style.textAlign`: `left` \| `center` \| `right`) sets where text sits inside that box, independent of Anchor (Bottom left + Align right is valid). Clicking an Anchor sets Alignment to that Anchor's side once; the operator may change it after. Alignment is placement, so changing it does not flip News / Show to Custom. Subtitle `scale` only multiplies type size (`1` = ffmpeg FontSize 16.1 / PlayRes 288, about 5.6% of frame height); Show preset Scale 1 is about 7.2%.

**Logo payload jsonb:** `imageUrl` (http(s) or app path such as `/icons/3d/apps.png` — **never** a `data:image` base64 string), `fileName`. "Choose local image" uploads PNG/WebP to the public Storage bucket `cg-logo` (`CgService.uploadLogoImage`) and stores only the public URL. Additive SQL: `supabase/sql/cg-logo-storage.sql`. Overlay subscribes to Realtime broadcast `cg-output:{token}` (full snapshot on Save / lines change; live cue is `{ kind: 'cue', layerId, index, cursor, seq }`). Full fetch is `tyapp_cg_get_output_by_token` on connect, plus a 30s safety poll that first calls `tyapp_cg_get_output_version_by_token` and skips the download when `updated_at` is unchanged. Do not go back to fast polling, and do not drop `tyapp_cg_*` tables.

**Subtitle payload jsonb:** `lines` (string[] — one cue per element; a cue may contain `\n`), `index` (`number` \| `null` = blank / off air), `cursor` (last clicked row; kept when Blank), `style.preset` (`news` \| `show` \| `custom`; default `news`), optional `style.fontFamily` (CSS stack), `transition.duration_ms` (cue crossfade; `0` = cut, default `400`). This is **not** Package Appear. `normalizeSubtitlePayload` must not re-parse stored `lines` (that would split dual-line SRT cues and desync `index`).

Tokens share one `/o/:token` space (unique across both tables in practice). Do not add a token table.

## RPCs
`tyapp_cg_package_soft_delete_single_record`, `tyapp_cg_layer_soft_delete_single_record`, `tyapp_cg_get_output_by_token`, `tyapp_cg_layer_set_cue` (jsonb_set `index`/`cursor` only), `tyapp_cg_get_output_version_by_token`. Additive SQL: `supabase/sql/cg-layer-cue.sql` (run in the SQL editor before the frontend that calls them).

## On air source (locked)
Panel **On air** is rendered by `CgProgram` (same component as the public overlay) from `CgService.onAirOutput` / `onAirCue`. These are set only after a Realtime `send` succeeds, from the same RPC output (`tyapp_cg_get_output_by_token`) the overlay receives. Do not rebuild an On air mirror from the draft. Pending (Studio) stays `CgMixPreview` on the draft. Layer Output (`/o/<layer token>`) ignores Package On/Off by design.

**Logo `px`** layouts are authored on a 1920-wide canvas (`CG_STAGE_REFERENCE_WIDTH_PX`) and rendered as a share of Stage width (`--cg-u`), so tile / desk / OBS are proportional. Natural image size follows the same rule.

## Host vs inner
Package / Panel owns mix — which Layers exist, On/Off, z-order, OBS URL, **Appear** (Fade / Cut + `duration_ms` for the whole Layer going on or off), and **Package Look** as master bus. Package B&W greys **every** Layer (Layer Color cannot punch out). Package Color lets a Layer set Color / B&W. Layer desk has no Appear. Cue crossfade, News / Show, layout live on the Layer (`payload.transition.duration_ms` for cue). Package Cut must not force cue to cut. Each Layer fades in/out on its own using Package `duration_ms`; unchanged Layers stay put. Tile order is Stage **z-order** (first behind, last in front).

## Ownership (locked)
Package Studio gates **mix only** (membership, On/Off, z-order, Package Look, Appear). **Layer content** never waits for Package Take and never marks Package Unsaved. All Layer content (Logo and Subtitle: Name / Look / Source / Place / cue / Style) is always Live; there is no Layer Studio mode. The Layer desk warns when the layer is really on air. Take/Create flushes pending Layer Live writes, then updates mix columns only on existing layer rows (new rows still full-insert on first Create).

## Save scope
| Mode | Behavior |
|---|---|
| Studio | **Take** applies name, role, Appear, Package Look, and every Layer's existence / On-Off / z-order — not Layer content. Logo Live + subtitle cue write through; Logo Draft waits for Apply |
| Direct | Package mix auto-saves (~450ms, quiet toast). Layer content uses its own Live / Draft path |

## Subtitle cue (live exception)
Up / Down / click / Blank patch only `index` / `cursor` immediately (no Package Save): optimistic local state, small Realtime `{ kind: 'cue' }` on Package + Layer tokens, then coalesced `tyapp_cg_layer_set_cue` (latest wins; does not rewrite `lines`). Paste / Load .txt or .srt still patch the full `lines` array and publish a full overlay snapshot. Cue Fade / Cut patches `payload.transition.duration_ms` the same way. Unsaved News/Show must not leak to OBS. Overlay shows `lines[index]` and crossfades cues inside the caption (not Layer opacity). `index = null` is blank; `cursor` stays so Down continues and Up goes back. SRT import strips sequence numbers and timestamps; each cue is one queue line.

## Copy Layer
INSERTs a new row into another Package: new PK, new `public_token` (never share the OBS URL), `index = null`. Additive SQL: `supabase/sql/cg-layer-look.sql`. Layer name SQL: `supabase/sql/cg-layer-name.sql`.

## Do not revive
`tyapp_cg_slot`, `component_type`, `_cg-theme.scss` (and its mixins).
